Fuzz: box rad 10px wid 1.8 ht 0.84 "Fuzz band" at (0, 0)
Region: box rad 10px wid 1.8 ht 0.84 "Region checks" at Fuzz + (0, -1.35)
Semantic: box rad 10px wid 1.8 ht 0.84 "Semantic checks" at Region + (0, -1.35)
Verdict: box rad 10px wid 1.8 ht 1.8 "One verdict" at Region + (3.7, 0)
arrow from Fuzz.e right 1.4 down 0.8 right 0.5 "whole image"
arrow from Region.e to Verdict.w "ink and SSIM"
arrow from Semantic.e right 1.4 up 0.8 right 0.5 "text and pages"
